Reports 01–20 record inspection on October 25, 2026. [GAF roof costs](https://www.gaf.com/en-us/plan-design/homeowner-education/roof-cost), [EPA plumbing](https://www.epa.gov/watersense/home-maintenance), [PNNL AC replacement](https://basc.pnnl.gov/home-improvement-expert/checklists/air-conditioner-replacement), [NIOSH electrical safety](https://www.cdc.gov/niosh/electrical-safety/about/) and [EPA landscaping](https://www.epa.gov/watersense/landscaping-tips) provide guidance, not job findings/rates. [CSLB contracts](https://cslb.ca.gov/Consumers/Hire_A_Contractor/Home_Improvement_Contracts/What_Is_A_Contract.aspx) concerns California home improvement, not universal law. [Amazon transcription](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/transcribe/latest/dg/streaming-partial-results.html), [Anthropic PDFs](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/pdf-support), [Microsoft formulas](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/office/open-xml/spreadsheet/working-with-formulas) and [Google free/busy](https://developers.google.com/workspace/calendar/api/v3/reference/freebusy/query) describe provider-specific behavior; verify the deployed route. [OWASP authorization](https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Authorization_Cheat_Sheet.html) is guidance, not implementation proof.
